[{"kind":"html","html":"<p>The tab component is a child component of <a class=\"\" href=\"/components/tabs\">tabs</a>. Each tab can contain a top level navigation stack for an app or a single view. An app can have many tabs, all with their own independent navigation.</p><div class=\"theme-admonition theme-admonition-note admonition_xJq3 alert alert--secondary\"><div class=\"admonitionHeading_Gvgb\"><span class=\"admonitionIcon_Rf37\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M6.3 5.69a.942.942 0 0 1-.28-.7c0-.28.09-.52.28-.7.19-.18.42-.28.7-.28.28 0 .52.09.7.28.18.19.28.42.28.7 0 .28-.09.52-.28.7a1 1 0 0 1-.7.3c-.28 0-.52-.11-.7-.3zM8 7.99c-.02-.25-.11-.48-.31-.69-.2-.19-.42-.3-.69-.31H6c-.27.02-.48.13-.69.31-.2.2-.3.44-.31.69h1v3c.02.27.11.5.31.69.2.2.42.31.69.31h1c.27 0 .48-.11.69-.31.2-.19.3-.42.31-.69H8V7.98v.01zM7 2.3c-3.14 0-5.7 2.54-5.7 5.68 0 3.14 2.56 5.7 5.7 5.7s5.7-2.55 5.7-5.7c0-3.15-2.56-5.69-5.7-5.69v.01zM7 .98c3.86 0 7 3.14 7 7s-3.14 7-7 7-7-3.12-7-7 3.14-7 7-7z\"></path></svg></span>note</div><div class=\"admonitionContent_BuS1\"><p>Angular, React, and Vue can only use this component when the <code>ion-tabs</code> component is configured for <a class=\"\" href=\"/components/tabs#basic-usage\">basic usage</a>. When setting up tabs with routing, the <code>ion-tab</code> component cannot be used.</p><p>In JavaScript, this component can be used with the <code>ion-tabs</code> component configured for either <a class=\"\" href=\"/components/tabs#basic-usage\">basic usage</a> or <a class=\"\" href=\"/components/tabs#usage-with-router\">usage with router</a>.</p></div></div><p>Refer to the <a class=\"\" href=\"/components/tabs\">tabs documentation</a> for more details on configuring tabs.</p>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"properties","text":"Properties"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"prop-component","text":"component"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>The component to display inside of the tab.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Attribute</strong></td><td><code>component</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Type</strong></td><td><code>Function ｜ HTMLElement ｜ null ｜ string ｜ undefined</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default</strong></td><td><code>undefined</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"prop-tab","text":"tab"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>A tab id must be provided for each <code>ion-tab</code>. It's used internally to reference the selected tab or by the router to switch between them.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Attribute</strong></td><td><code>tab</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Type</strong></td><td><code>string</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default</strong></td><td><code>undefined</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"events","text":"Events"},{"kind":"html","html":"<p>No events available for this component.</p>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"methods","text":"Methods"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"method-set-active","text":"setActive"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>Set the active component for the tab</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Signature</strong></td><td><code>setActive() =&gt; Promise&lt;void&gt;</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"css-shadow-parts","text":"CSS Shadow Parts"},{"kind":"html","html":"<p>No CSS shadow parts available for this component.</p>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"css-custom-properties","text":"CSS Custom Properties"},{"kind":"html","html":"<p>No CSS custom properties available for this component.</p>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"slots","text":"Slots"},{"kind":"html","html":"<p>No slots available for this component.</p>"}]